stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PlanBatches
    PlanBatches --> Failed : one root tree is over the batch limit
    PlanBatches --> OnePayload : everything fits one batch
    PlanBatches --> Batches : two or more batches (a failed summary's matching ones are reused)
    OnePayload --> FinalAnswer
    state Batches {
        [*] --> AllBatches : every batch at once, within the provider's limits
        AllBatches --> [*] : all complete
    }
    Batches --> Failed : a batch fails, queued ones do not start, running ones finish
    Batches --> FinalAnswer : findings fit the evidence budget
    Batches --> Condense : findings over the evidence budget
    Condense --> Condense : another level, up to 8
    Condense --> FinalAnswer : findings fit
    Condense --> Failed : a level does not shrink them, or 8 levels
    FinalAnswer --> Done : streamed answer with citations
    Done --> [*] : kept batches dropped
    Failed --> [*] : finished batches kept for continuing
